This software is the fifth module of a twenty-project research-software portfolio on income,
wealth, taxation, inequality, and intergenerational mobility in Sweden, produced at the
Department of Economics, Stockholm University.

No real personal data, no real microdata, and no real kinship graphs are committed to this
repository. All data fixtures are synthetic and released under CC0-1.0. Crosswalk tables are
curated annotations of publicly available SCB geographic reference data.

